  "title": "White Chocolate and Macadamia Nut Cookies",
  "description": "These cookies have 2 ingredients not normally found in a white chocolate-macadamia nut cookie: oatmeal and coconut. The result is a perfect holiday cookie with a chewy center and crisp edges.",
  "authors": [
